    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your patron is a noble efreeti of the Elemental Plane of Fire. Efreet are the noble genies of the Elemental Plane of Fire: cruel, scheming tyrants of the City of Brass who prize power and obedience.</p><p><strong>Genie's Wrath.</strong> The extra damage of your Genie's Wrath is Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Elemental Gift.</strong> At Warlock level 6, your Elemental Gift grants you Resistance to Fire damage.</p><p><strong>Genie Spells.</strong> Your kind adds the following spells to your Genie Spells: @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplBurningHan]{Burning Hands}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplScorchingR]{Scorching Ray} (level 3); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireball00]{Fireball} (level 5); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFireShield]{Fire Shield} (level 7); @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplFlameStrik]{Flame Strike} (level 9).</p>",
